      "details": "\r\n<p>Isola di Favignana is the full name of the major of the Aegadian islands. Although it is very often called just \"Favignana\", the full name is useful to disambiguate, as \"Favignana\" also refers to the municipality of Favignana, that includes the islands of Marettimo and Levanza as well.</p>\r\n",
